 "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n4le01ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "A particular phenomenon of technology is the rapidly and constant advance in any of its domains. A concrete example that illustrates this argument is the software tool CASE. This acronym obeys to the name of Computer Aided Software Engineering. CASE is an operating system software to design applications in a productive way, reducing costs and time. It works with two types of tools: The Upper CASE tools, specialized in business maintenance, access to data and data transferring, as flow diagrams and decision tables. And, the second ones, the Lower CASE tools, which are as important as the first ones, but are specialized in operational activities like design and debugging."}, {"time": "49300", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "Now then, as any software application, CASE faces some risks, such as: First, lack of training; a CASE programmer needs time to practice and explore in depth the software features. Second, lack of accuracy in the software execution. If the programmer doesn't know how to run the program and take advantage of the innovative capabilities that CASE offers, it couldn't be useful at all.  Third, standardization difficulties. Depending on the company's requirements, engineers have to adapt CASE to each new methodology. And, fourth, improbable expectations, when marketing strategies extol the software qualities."}, {"time": "92700", "image": "enpe8n4le01ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "On the other hand, there are other software tools as the Computer Aided Design, or CAD, whose main functions are to create, modify and optimize designs. So, this one is as essential as CASE in any process that implies creation tools. This design software is quite used for the building, automotive and aerospace industries. It results as useful as CASE to improve the productivity and the quality in any particular task. And related to its applicability, with the appropriate training, it can be as easy to use as CASE."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n4le01ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "type": "scholar"}]}